  m_text: 'Moths circle a lamp. A few particles are born in a small sphere around the lamp head, and they never stop: a long lifetime, a loop and Prewarm. The Orbital value of Velocity over Lifetime turns them around the lamp, and Noise makes each path wander. Particles Simple Lit lets the lamp light them.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Unity Manual: Velocity over Lifetime module (Orbital), Noise module.</color></size>'
