      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=150%><b>9 \xB7 VFX: Particle effects</b></size>\nThe effects to look up and use. Each one is a prefab in the Asset Library, in Effects.\n\n<b>Row 1 \xB7 Water:</b> 1 Rain with splashes \xB7 2 Drips from a ceiling \xB7 3 Steam from a vent\n<b>Row 2 \xB7 Air and light:</b> 4 Dust in a light shaft \xB7 5 Filler dust \xB7 6 Moths around a lamp \xB7 7 Sparks from a failing sign"
