  m_text: "Dust is visible only where light passes through it. These motes use the Dust Back-Scatter shader: each adds the light that reaches it, most when the light shines toward the camera, and nothing in shadow. A lit billboard cannot do this: lit from behind, it shows its dark side.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Shader library, Light and space: Dust Back-Scatter (the toolbox). Compare with 8 \xB7 Atmosphere, Volumetric-Fog: shafts.</color></size>"
