  m_text: 'Steam is a few large, soft, half-transparent cards that rise, grow and fade. Size over Lifetime makes them grow, and Color over Lifetime fades them in and out. Soft Particles fade a card where it cuts into the floor. Camera Fading fades it when it comes close to the camera.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Unity Manual: Particles Simple Lit shader (Soft Particles, Camera Fading).</color></size>'
