  m_text: 'Filler dust floats through a whole space, whatever the lights. The motes are small and faint: Particles Unlit with Alpha blending. They are born anywhere in a large box, drift slowly with Noise and live long. Prewarm starts the effect as if it had already run once, so the box is full at once.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Unity Manual: Main module (Prewarm), Noise module.</color></size>'
