  m_text: 'A failing sign throws sparks now and then. Bursts of 12 to 25 particles, with a Probability below 1, fly fast from the tube''s end. Gravity pulls them down and Collision makes them bounce on the floor. They are Additive with a bright emission colour, so Bloom makes them glow; Trails draws their tails.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Shader library, Light and space: Dying-Tube (the toolbox).</color></size>'
